#==============================================================================================
#
#   navigable_container_viewport_paintable - Painting::NavigableContainerViewportPaintable:
#                                            the paintable of an <iframe>'s viewport
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/NavigableContainerViewportPaintable.cpp (lines 1-70) and
#       NavigableContainerViewportPaintable.h: creation, and painting the hosted document's
#       content (its navigable's external content source) clipped to the rounded box.
